        "created_at": "2014-11-29T03:35:21.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>It's like a club, you go hang out for the evening, maybe muck about out back after it closes for a while, but eventually the party ends.</p><p>But if you go back the next morning, there are always those folks that would rather sleep in a puddle of their own piss than admit the party was over. &nbsp;They tend to groan a lot and yell at the sun when you wake them up to tell them to go home.</p>",
